<Song resolves-to="SongSP" spName="MyBlueHeaven-Eb-Theme" spTempo="142">
  <spVERSION>4</spVERSION>
  <spComments>Year:	1924 (first published 1927)
Composer:	Walter Donaldson
Lyricist:	George A. Whiting
Form:	32-bar AABA
Style:	Jazz/popular song; foxtrot
Key:	E-flat major

Donaldson wrote the music in 1924, and the song was
published in 1927 and featured in the Ziegfeld Follies that
year. Gene Austin’s 1927 recording helped make it a major
hit and a lasting standard. </spComments>
